title: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Re-verify a patient
route: /authorizations/eligibility (and /authorizations/eligibility/R-1042)
intro: Three ways to check a patient again. A row's 'Re-check' and the result's 'Check again' run the same quick re-check, and so does 'Refresh verification' in New case: all three refresh the one shared verification record. Opening 'Verify a patient' from a case runs the full live check again.
dir: TD
also: Demo only: a re-check never changes the answer. R-1101 stays lapsed. The re-checks Verify runs on its own, when the Demo clock passes a booked time, are in 'Re-check on its own'.
---
start a1 "On the list, click 'Re-check' on a row"
start a2 "On a result, click 'Check again'"
start a3 "Open 'Verify a patient' from a case and click 'Check now'"
start a4 "In New case, step 2, click 'Refresh verification'"

decision q1 "Is a re-check already running for this patient?"
process p1 "The click is ignored\nThe button is off with a spinner"
process p2 "Patient marked as checking\nList: button reads 'Checking' with a spinner, the quiet second line says 'Checking now'\nResult: 'Check again' shows a spinner"
agent g0 "Verify and the other agents ask again"
ext x1 "The state and the plan\n(demo: simulated, same answer as before)"
wait w1 "About 1.1 seconds"
decision qv "Is Verify paused in Settings?"
store st1 "Verification record replaced\nChecked time is now, any booked re-check cleared, verdict unchanged\nA check that never ran ('Not checked') is asked again for real"
store st3 "Record kept as it was, with the warning\n'Verification service unavailable'\nChecked time unchanged"
toast t3 "'Could not re-check R-1042'\n'Verify is paused in Settings, so nothing was asked. The last result is still shown.'"

decision q2 "Does the payer need a phone call? (Evergreen)"
toast t1 "'R-1042 re-checked'\n'Still Authorization first.' ('Now Cleared to bill.' when a check that never ran has answered)"
toast t2 "'R-0975 re-checked'\n'The plan's system did not answer, so Caller phoned. Still Fix before billing.'"

group gAfter "What changes on screen"
  process r1 "List: 'Checked 3 h ago' becomes 'Checked just now'"
  process r2 "List: tile 'Re-check due' goes down by one if this row had a re-check booked"
  process r3 "Result: 'Time checked' in the facts line, 'Sat 10:40 am, 3 d ago', becomes '10:42 am, live'"
  process r4 "Verdict, sidebar badge and the other tiles do not change"
endgroup

process v1 "Opens the verify form pre-filled from the case\nThen the full live check (about 10 seconds)"
goto g1 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › The check finishes and is saved"
goto g2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Re-check on its own"
end e1 "Patient is up to date"

a1 --> q1
a2 --> q1
a4 --> q1
q1 -->|Yes| p1
q1 -->|No| p2 --> w1 --> qv
qv -->|No| g0 --> x1 --> st1 --> q2
qv -->|Yes| st3 --> t3 --> e1
q2 -->|No| t1
q2 -->|Yes| t2
t1 --> r1 & r3 & r4
t2 --> r1 & r3 & r4
r1 --> r2 --> e1
r3 --> e1
r4 --> e1
r2 -.-> g2
a3 --> v1 --> g1
